  (rectangle (start 15.24 25.4) (end 121.92 132.08) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 31425a8e-e40c-5db9-85cc-fe5825f210bf))
  (text "USB-C + ESD" (at 17.78 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1ec47504-5970-544b-a90a-bb31ccab784b))
  (text "USB 2.0 FS goes to the ESP32-H2 USB-Serial/JTAG pins (GPIO26 = D-, GPIO27 = D+).\nR1, R2: Rd 5.1k = USB-C sink.  R14, R15: 0R placeholders for EMI tuning." (at 17.78 129 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7e97fafe-d789-5a9c-a807-c4699d69d206))
  (rectangle (start 127 25.4) (end 226.06 132.08) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 9ff87e66-6e07-5f67-924e-5e28102be31a))
  (text "LiPo charger" (at 129.54 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0b6ecbe6-bbe9-5ec3-aebd-f0a4da97bab9))
  (text "Ichg = 1000 V / R3 = 213 mA (R3 = 4.7k): size R3 for <= 0.5 C of the cell.\nD2 lit = charging (STAT low).  No power-path: the load stays on the battery.\nJ2 = solder pads on the bottom side: pad 1 = BAT+, pad 2 = BAT-.  CHECK THE POLARITY." (at 129.54 128.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 614f83d7-6d9f-5454-9d95-f42fa1072f52))
  (rectangle (start 231.14 25.4) (end 304.8 78.74) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 22c57bc6-04db-50b0-8ae7-896470354eaf))
  (text "3V3 LDO" (at 233.68 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 64ea1a3a-088e-5b2d-bb4d-09b5f81f1629))
  (text "RT9080-33GJ5: Iq 2 uA, 600 mA.  EN tied to VIN (always on).\nPinout 1=VIN 2=GND 3=EN 4=NC 5=VOUT, same as\nTPS7A0533PDBV and XC6220B331MR-G (alternates)." (at 233.68 70.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d71b44a6-1933-5638-98c2-32962a4c82da))
  (rectangle (start 231.14 83.82) (end 304.8 132.08) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid a1cc7157-1e86-5f3d-ad24-dda3ba0a0203))
  (text "Design notes" (at 233.68 90.17 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0ac79857-3214-5ca6-a054-d8a19269b29b))
  (text "PCB: 4 layers recommended (sig / GND / PWR / sig), 1.6 mm.\nU1: antenna at the board edge, no copper on any\nlayer under or beside it (keep-out is in the footprint).\nSolid GND plane under everything else; stitch vias.\nUSB D+/D-: route as a pair, short, over GND.\nU2: away from the board edge, buttons and battery\nconnector; no vias or traces under the LGA.\nBattery leads and C2 close to J2 / U4.\nThis sheet is generated: edit hardware/gen/gen_kicad.py." (at 233.68 112.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1957d558-2ab6-5fe4-9e6b-403729380a34))
  (rectangle (start 309.88 25.4) (end 406.4 132.08) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 50ebf2f3-7721-523b-8dec-6ddc79455168))
  (text "Battery sense (switched divider)" (at 312.42 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0e23e98f-b0f6-5855-aaff-290875a1a031))
  (text "VBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 while VBAT_SENSE_EN (GPIO0) is high; settle >= 3 ms.\nGPIO0 low or floating (deep sleep): R11 keeps Q2 off, R10 keeps Q1 off,\nso the divider draws only leakage.  ADC input: GPIO1 = ADC1_CH0." (at 312.42 123.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d58d4991-32f9-5bf0-b8c6-066a98d98c45))
  (rectangle (start 15.24 137.16) (end 175.26 246.38) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid f5f908cf-6a7b-5ffc-af19-c970d4a16bec))
  (text "MCU ESP32-H2-WROOM-02C" (at 17.78 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 628d7782-1826-55a2-afe8-2b855bd2560a))
  (text "Strapping: GPIO8 pulled up (R8); GPIO9 = BOOT, pulled up (R7), SW1 pulls it low.\nGPIO25 (JTAG source strap) is unused: it is ignored with the default eFuses.\nEN: the 10k / 1uF power-up RC is inside the module.  VBAT pin = 3V3 (module default).\nGPIO10 / GPIO11 / GPIO9 are LP IOs (GPIO7..14) and can wake the chip from deep sleep.\nDecoupling C5 + C6 right at module pin 1.  Keep the antenna area free of copper." (at 17.78 241.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 45801bc6-6c43-590b-b2d1-a2fe270a8d13))
  (rectangle (start 180.34 137.16) (end 284.48 246.38) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 3c4a4662-2fad-5abf-8a3a-d856392c1871))
  (text "Accelerometer LIS2DH12" (at 182.88 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 55616374-3bc8-5207-b613-67fc76e3958b))
  (text "I2C address 0x19 (SA0 high).  CS high selects I2C.  RES (pin 5) to GND.\nINT1 -> GPIO10: FIFO watermark, wakes the MCU.  INT2 -> GPIO11: reserved.\nThe sensor stays powered in sleep (about 2 uA at 1 Hz).  C7 / C9 right at the pins." (at 182.88 237.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 18277c6a-e11d-5e78-97f9-98dc72fa63a0))
  (rectangle (start 289.56 137.16) (end 358.14 246.38) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid f7d66c49-513f-5766-a9a6-4aec93b3e187))
  (text "Buttons / LED" (at 292.1 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1a94a022-b698-590d-90fc-464a4d8e4b29))
  (text "SW1: BOOT / user button (GPIO9, active low).\nSW2: reset (EN to GND).\nD1: status LED on GPIO22, active high." (at 292.1 237.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1183e362-cddf-56e3-b66e-53b9de7d4186))
  (rectangle (start 363.22 137.16) (end 406.4 246.38) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid e9d5a842-0b7b-5bad-aefd-e3635d1ba0b6))
  (text "Test points" (at 365.76 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e34bfbc5-8421-5351-bfa4-57d80e1d9303))
  (text "1.0 mm pads for pogo pins:\nUART0 console, EN + BOOT\nfor flashing, supplies." (at 365.76 240.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd46d50d-6a70-5304-bd88-90f75809d61f))
